### 作者与独立证据 / Authorship and independent evidence

中文：公开作者身份、仓库提交责任与外部科研验证是不同属性；引用 ORCID、个人开源参与及 Zenodo DOI 不能证明可靠性实验已经独立复现或获机构背书

English: Public authorship, commit responsibility and independent research verification are distinct. ORCID, open-source participation and Zenodo DOI do not establish independent reproduction or institutional endorsement

